rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How much should I budget for kitchen fitting labour?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[#C8A97E] text-xl leading-none group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform flex-shrink-0","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-5 text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-50 pt-4","children":["There is no reliable single percentage for kitchen fitting labour. The amount depends on the room, preparation, access, number of trades, materials and whether plumbing or electrics need moving. An itemised, project-specific quote is the best way to budget accurately."]}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["What is usually included in a full kitchen renovation?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[#C8A97E] text-xl leading-none group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform flex-shrink-0","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-5 text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-50 pt-4","children":["A full renovation may include removal, preparation, cabinets, worktops, appliances, plumbing, electrical work, flooring, tiling, decorating and installation. Check each quotation carefully because inclusions vary between contractors."]}]]}],["$","details","4",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 